   - apps/api/app/services/ask.py: answer_question(query: str) -> AskAnswer. Steps: embed(query) → top_k → format chunks as "[<filename>] <content>" → call llm.complete(prompt) → parse via AskAnswer → save PromptRun (prompt_name=ask_company, version=v1, document_id=null, status=success/failed) → return.
   - apps/api/app/api/ask.py: POST /api/ask {"query": str} → 200 AskAnswer. CORS already wired.
