   - apps/api/app/schemas/draft_reply.py: DraftReply Pydantic.
   - apps/api/app/analyzers/draft_reply_generator.py: DraftReplyGenerator. applies_to={"client_request"}. run() embeds (document.raw_text) → top_k filtered to OTHER documents (exclude this doc's own chunks) → formats COMPANY_CONTEXT → calls llm.complete with EMAIL_TEXT={raw_text} + COMPANY_CONTEXT → parses DraftReply → returns AnalyzerResult.
